<title>USA: El Salvador seeks PL-480 vegoil for October-agent.</title>
<headline>El Salvador seeks PL-480 vegoil for October-agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador was seeking approximately 4,000 to 5,000 tonnes prime bleachable summer yellow (PBSY) cottonseed oil in bulk and about 750 to 1,240 tonnes sunflowerseed oil under the PL-480, Title 1 export program, its U.S. export agent said.</p>
<p>Both commodities were slated for October 1-15 shipment,</p>
<p>Offers were due on August 14, the agent said.</p>
<p>Contracts will be awarded on the basis of maximum five percent less at buyer's option.</p>
<p>(Doris Frankel 312-983-7305)</p>
